{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PARRY COUNTER is a 2D side-scrolling action game inspired by Soulslike mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget fighting hordes of weak enemies\u2014here, you face only powerful, relentless bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to destroy the Magic Stones that continue to threaten the world, confronting the deadly foes these stones summon along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your guard perfectly to nullify enemy attacks the moment they would hit you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682280/extras/2e882928b38bc78f0d597754030cd2d7.poster.avif?t=1770725972\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682280/extras/2e882928b38bc78f0d597754030cd2d7.webm?t=1770725972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682280/extras/2e882928b38bc78f0d597754030cd2d7.mp4?t=1770725972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Counter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike back immediately after a successful parry to unleash a devastating counterattack. Chain multiple parries in succession to trigger even more powerful counters, turning precise timing into overwhelming force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682280/extras/cc004536a563c7e3f88260646c732587.poster.avif?t=1770725972\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682280/extras/cc004536a563c7e3f88260646c732587.webm?t=1770725972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682280/extras/cc004536a563c7e3f88260646c732587.mp4?t=1770725972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat a total of 5 bosses, including the tutorial boss. The expected playtime is around 1 to 2 hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed entirely by a 17-year-old.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to post and stream videos of this game, whether you are an individual or a corporation. However, we ask that you please follow these guidelines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever possible, please include the name of the game in your video title.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to the Steam page in your video's description, though it is not mandatory.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hakunaku bears no responsibility for any damages incurred from posting or streaming videos of this game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be aware that these guidelines are subject to change without prior notice.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682280?t=1770725972","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682280?t=1770725972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682280/562912fd41ad034825e46eb9cfecca165015aabf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770725972","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682280/562912fd41ad034825e46eb9cfecca165015aabf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770725972","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descripti